  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JIBS 2011-2019, AAU Forskningssammarbete</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JIBS 2011-2019, AAU Research collaboration - J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;ping cooperation AAU</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anslag f&#xf6;r t&#xe4;ckande av Handelsh&#xf6;gskolan i J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;pings l&#xf6;nekostnader    f&#xf6;r deltagande i konsortier f&#xf6;r forskarutbildning vid Addis Ababa     universitetet i Etiopien 2011-2015. Addis Ababa University st&#xe5;r f&#xf6;r   kostnader f&#xf6;r resor, logi och traktamenten i Etiopien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Appropriation to cover supervisory costs for participatioin in        consortia for research training at Addis Ababa University in Ethiopia 2011 to 2015. Addis Ababa university is responsible for travel,       accommodation and per diem in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </description>
